      "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.4.1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise of The Kingdom Part 1 Bug Fixes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random NPC's avatars appearing when talking to the peasants fixed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills now can only be reset if player unequip everithing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countrywomen has been changed to Countrywoman</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ted Boat bullets exploit fixed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trading System displaying the incorrect amount of an item fixed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise of The Kingdom Part 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New NPC’s that can be found around Towns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Daily Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Trading System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Alchemist Boss fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Platforms on Water Towns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement Overhaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Sprinting on PC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Acceleration has been increased</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai Overhaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Mobs are a bit smarter and don’t fall off cliffs or into the water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added 2 rows of inventory space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Liquid Fog. This can protect you against Mati and increase your mana recharge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Scroll of Oblivion, an item that resets your skill points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed Stuttering Bug</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed Mobile Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.3.4.2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added option to disable jumping sounds </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disabled knock back system for most of the regular mobs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving and loading date time with international ISO 8601 format for all regions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.3.4.1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Vertical Sync option to disable screen tearing (PC)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.3.4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Button to collapse and pause application on Android</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed timers for pet revive and daily quests in some regions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small fixes and improvements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.3.3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added records items for all new music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed daily quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed pet revive timers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music doesn't cut out and boss music loops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting to disable music change until it finishes playing </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed elevator rotations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed arrow exploit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mute toggle now mute all sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Space Layer 3 music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mati boss has new music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.3.2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compile to native code for better performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed textures on terrain quality 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed dig particles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.3.1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.3.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated the game engine to the latest version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved save logic to prevent character breakage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New block Sentinel's Branch (prevents creatures from spawning) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumbleweed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed daily quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed errors where items disappeared from inventory </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet resurrection confirmation window</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors now save their state</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New ability for the Swamp Golem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After death in survival and hardcore modes, items lie 3 times longer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music for boss battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many balance and crafting improvements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed many bugs and imperfections</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.2.2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mass build for Replicator and Destroyer in Creative mode (can be found in creative settings menu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some fixes and improvements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.2.1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed earthquake</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.2.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed a bug where the New Year's hat could be displayed on the Gontar pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy Metal swords no longer drop in Hardcore and Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins for trading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins may fall out when digging blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recipe for melting coins in a furnace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to purchase more than one item at a time in stores</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed display of dragon armor in the Alchemist shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grass does not grow or spread if it is painted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bat spawns in caves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions now ignite fireworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed game icon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed distortion of the sound of melodies when the character moves quickly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadow Ax now restores 1 mana per second instead of 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed recipes for Ashkor, Xordaraxus and Dragonlord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed opening inventory of Cats and Dogs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miner's helmet gives 15 armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed Sun Shard staff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some translation corrections and item descriptions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many small bugs and improvements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.1.1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduced grass growth in world generation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed duck and seaweed spawner digging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed damage of fireballs and rockets of hostile creatures from any distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved cloud animation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drops now last twice as long</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added smoke from aircraft exhaust pipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a button with a link to the channel in Discord in the main menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some building improvements, jungle biome and other changes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.1.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New preset pixel texture pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity and many new blocks to create complex mechanisms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawners, dynamite, fireworks, doors and many other blocks can be activated with a click or electricity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New transport aircraft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick and wall clock block</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Musical blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painting amber blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grass grows automatically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character can climb chains and vines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cobweb, swamp and lava slows down the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotation of triangular blocks and hatches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI improvements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved weather and fog performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New more realistic sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloring the sky in different colors when summoning magical creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skull block activation toggles weather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knockback effect when taking damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved some digging and block setting mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed wheat work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hoe now turns grass to earth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks destroyed by explosion now drop loot and activate physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rockets destroy blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Particles of lights on lava</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ash effect in hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New achievements and mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruction of buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New hidden chests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many bug fixes and improvements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.0.8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show vehicles on radar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Dropbox backup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many bug fixes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V 13.0.6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*******</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Survival Game Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Dragon Eldriar Pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Transport Locomotive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles are now saved in the game world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle painting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New block Railway dead end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved models of some creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet Armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the chests found in the game world you can find useful items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory item destroy button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved main menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backups via Dropbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meteorites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recalculated the level of the main character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New types of achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many bugs fixed</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a world of vast landscapes where you have ultimate control. You decide where to go and what to build. Fly on dragons and other creatures as you embark on an epic quest to save the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block Story®</strong> combines popular 3D block building, sandbox exploration gameplay with exciting and addictive role playing game elements. Complete quests to conquer diverse biomes and become the greatest warrior in the realm. Build strongholds, encounter a wide variety of creatures, battle boss monsters, and mine valuable resources to upgrade weaponry, access better equipment and create artifacts to summon monsters of all sorts -- including dragons! The first chapter of your story begins... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features</u>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover several totally new and exciting quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from a wise Wizard on how to discover the many wonders of Block Story </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride on dragons and more then 30 other creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn free diamonds for playing four days in a row <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite hours of RPG exploration game play </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore numerous biomes from desert wastelands to arctic mountain ranges and even space! But look out for the dragons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter numerous supporting characters that will assist you on your quests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your hero with customized stats and attributes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the crafting system to forge a slew of magical items – from lighting swords, mystical staves and rare artifacts that summon dragons and other creatures that will aid you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build different mechanisms with the new electrical system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a variety of mechanical vehicles from a simple boat and railroad to an airplane that will allow you to soar through the skies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve complex mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a world of vast landscapes where you have ultimate control. You decide where to go and what to build. Fly on dragons and other creatures as you embark on an epic quest to save the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block Story®</strong> combines popular 3D block building, sandbox exploration gameplay with exciting and addictive role playing game elements. Complete quests to conquer diverse biomes and become the greatest warrior in the realm. Build strongholds, encounter a wide variety of creatures, battle boss monsters, and mine valuable resources to upgrade weaponry, access better equipment and create artifacts to summon monsters of all sorts -- including dragons! The first chapter of your story begins... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features</u>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover several totally new and exciting quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from a wise Wizard on how to discover the many wonders of Block Story </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride on dragons and more then 30 other creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn free diamonds for playing four days in a row <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite hours of RPG exploration game play </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore numerous biomes from desert wastelands to arctic mountain ranges and even space! But look out for the dragons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter numerous supporting characters that will assist you on your quests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your hero with customized stats and attributes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the crafting system to forge a slew of magical items – from lighting swords, mystical staves and rare artifacts that summon dragons and other creatures that will aid you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build different mechanisms with the new electrical system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a variety of mechanical vehicles from a simple boat and railroad to an airplane that will allow you to soar through the skies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve complex mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>",
      "short_description": "There isn’t much better than a wide open game world in which you have essentially no limits and can alter the very landscape in which you play – that is, unless you add dragons, of course…",
      "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese",
      "reviews": "“If you’re entirely new to block building games, Block Story is loads of fun and full of ingenious gameplay.”<br>4.4 / 5.0 – AndroidTapp<br><br>“Overall, I found Block Story to be a joy to play, not to mention a highly polished product.  One of the complaints I had with Minecraft is that it didn’t include any sort of in-depth RPG element.  Block Story helped to bridge this gap and provide hours of entertainment in both the realm of building and character progression.”<br>9 / 10 – Dad's Gaming Addiction<br><br>“Block Story is a a fun adventure that does very well to create a virtual terrain that begs to be discovered.  It is in parts charming, at others scary, and the dichotomy is part of its charm.”<br>8 / 10 – Android Rundown<br>",
